---
import '../styles/style.css';
import "../styles/profile-image.css";
import "../styles/socials.css";
import "../styles/cards.css";
import "../styles/youtube.css";
import "../styles/vrc-embed.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Relli's Stuff | VRC Price Sheet</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/relli_logo_100x100.png" type="image/x-icon" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"
    />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      type="text/css"
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/devicon.min.css"
    />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Aldrich&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/8e4463ebba.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="../scripts/background"></script>
  </head>

  <!-- Background -->
  <canvas id="background-canvas" width="600px"></canvas>

  <body>
    <div class="glass-backdrop">
      <canvas id="glass"></canvas>
      <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <header>
          <h1>THIS SITE IS UNDER CONSTRUCTION</h1>
          <h1>Custom VRChat Avatar Price Sheet</h1>
        </header>

        <section>
          <div class="grid-container">
            <div class="grid-header">
              <div class="title">Service</div>
              <div class="title">Starting Labor Cost (USD)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-content">
              <div>Standard Base Setup</div>
              <div>~$45 per</div>

              <div>Custom Textures</div>
              <div>~$20 per</div>

              <div>Blender Edits</div>
              <div>~$35 per</div>

              <div>From-Scratch Blender Work</div>
              <div>~$125 per</div>

              <div>Avatar Props</div>
              <div>~$5 per</div>

              <div>Custom Animations/Toggles</div>
              <div>~$15 per</div>

              <div>Shader Setup/Config</div>
              <div>~$20 per</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            *Prices shown are subject to change based on complexity and time demands of requested
            services.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2><u>Commission Timeline</u></h2>
          <p>The order of events for getting a commission is as follows:</p>
          <ol>
            <li>
              Commission details are discussed, and an <b>estimated total price</b> is given.
            </li>
          </ol>
          <div style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 110%; padding: 5px 0 15px 0">
            Est. total price = Est. labor cost + Paid asset costs
          </div>

          <ol start="2">
            <li>
              After the estimated total price is agreed upon, an <b>upfront payment</b> is calculated.
              <ul>
                <li>
                  The initial labor cost is an <u>estimate</u>, and is subject to change as work
                  progresses.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ol>
          <div class="grid-container">
            <div class="grid-header" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;">
              <div class="title">Est. Labor Cost</div>
              <div class="title">Upfront Payment</div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-content" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;">
              <div>$0 - $99</div>
              <div>Full price</div>

              <div>$100+</div>
              <div>30% of Est. Labor Cost + Asset Costs</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ol start="3">
            <li>
              After the upfront payment is processed, work on the commission begins.
              <ul>
                <li>Turnaround time: <b>~2 weeks</b> once started.</li>
                <li>
                  WIP updates will be sent to ensure the commissioner is happy with the final
                  product.
                </li>
                <li>
                  As major updates are sent, I will take breaks untill I receive a response
                  confirming everything looks good.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              If the commissioner requests large changes or additions, the total price is
              recalculated to account for extra labor.
              <ul>
                <li>
                  If requests include additional paid assets, assets must be paid for by the
                  commissioner <u>upfront</u>.
                </li>
                <li>
                  <u>Refunds will not be issued</u> for changes that override work that's already been
                  done.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              Once the commission is complete, the <b>final payment</b> is calculated.
              <ul></ul>
            </li>
          </ol>
          <div style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 110%; padding: 5px 0 15px 0">
            Final payment = Final total cost - Upfront payment
          </div>
          <ol start="6">
            <li>
              After the final payment is processed, the commissioned avatar is uploaded to the
              commissioner's VRChat account.
            </li>
          </ol>
        </section>
        
        <section>
          <h2><u>General TOS</u></h2>
          <ul>
            <li>I retain my right to turn down commissions.</li>
            <li>All prices advertised are based on USD currency.</li>
            <li>
              Feel free to DM me for concerns or order confirmations (please give me up to 24 hours
              to follow up!).
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        
        <section>
          <h2><u>Enterprise TOS</u></h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              All products are for personal use only unless a commercial license is purchased.
            </li>
            <li>
              Enterprise licenses are available for purchase after the commission is complete, and
              are calculated based on the final total cost.
            </li>
            <li>Commercial license rates are calculated as follows:</li>
            <div style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 110%; padding: 5px 0 15px 0">
              Enterprise license fee = Final total cost * 50%
            </div>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!--Background Options -->
        <footer>
          <div>
            <input type="checkbox" id="draw-dots" checked />
            <label for="draw-dots">Draw Dots Board</label>

            <input type="checkbox" id="enable-rotation" checked />
            <label for="enable-rotation">Enable Animation / Gradients rotation</label>

            <input type="checkbox" id="enable-interaction" checked />
            <label for="enable-interaction">Enable Interaction</label>
          </div>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>


</html>
